u7kEqqY5xj4MrD0lsfv4AHsemuJcsj9XTF-9ehKBdrse0JVwsdoTiH82D_5zV354j4dQQg-zt6T5pbK0KMJGJNX6SSG9kWkQ-1H1W5fu7Dt2_YJ0oIrHcVPp7mse-yIzilP4JZmDy_mOliBwqBDv6QRYBgENWluDUW3b_Qcn_FKeuw\u0026sa=X\u0026ved=2ahUKEwjz1OyFj4WYAxVoQEEAHdk7LMQ4ChDEqwkoAXoECBUQAQ\u0026ictx=0","domain":"www.google.com","options":null}]},"item_types":["ai_overview","organic","images","local_pack","knowledge_graph"],"se_results_count":52,"pages_count":2,"items_count":24,"items":[{"type":"ai_overview","rank_group":1,"rank_absolute":1,"page":1,"position":"left","xpath":"/html[1]/body[1]/div[3]/div[1]/div[13]/div[1]/div[1]/div[2]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]","asynchronous_ai_overview":false,"markdown":"Slovo **gavalier** \u0060m\u00E1 v slovenskom jazyku nieko\u013Eko v\u00FDznamov\u0060 . Naj\u010Dastej\u0161ie sa pou\u017E\u00EDva v t\u00FDchto s\u00FAvislostiach:\n\n### 1. V\u00FDznam slova (vlastnos\u0165)\n\n- **\u010Cestn\u00FD a charaktern\u00FD \u010Dlovek** \u2013 mu\u017E s vytri\u00EDben\u00FDm spr\u00E1van\u00EDm, ktor\u00FD sa spr\u00E1va \u0161\u013Eachetne, zdvorilo a ve\u013Ekoryso.\n- **Sprievodca d\u00E1my** \u2013 mu\u017E, ktor\u00FD sprev\u00E1dza \u017Eenu (napr\u00EDklad do spolo\u010Dnosti).[[1]](https://google.com/goto?url=CAESegHEIkXX749Q3ikuxL6Ioi3DApY5iRFDX2PUSxY-n3GPDtA1H1ehzPR7vhcvh7DvYrnzJK0oKIKPg2l4_KOXrjtwkVKc8jwnimgHHyf6c9D3RlfRU1pKq3uxVA8zB8wEnkePNgJhtUFZEap0bR6XLDStYQGaZZcC0DlW)\n\n### 2. Kaviare\u0148 a cukr\u00E1re\u0148 \u201EGavalier\u201C\n\nPod t\u00FDmto n\u00E1zvom funguj\u00FA zn\u00E1me prev\u00E1dzky na Slovensku:\n\n- **Bansk\u00E1 \u0160tiavnica** \u2013 [Kaviare\u0148 Gavalier](https://google.com/goto?url=CAESVgHEIkXXy3uAUiK89xKKI6qVpSWA3obq6Xtan0AVPfUjtwLWkLsUXP-rprr7amBOb5OgGPumWZUWcr3jbTnacIfpo3US5PLG0kX1_z0mxse-azfrTcjS) s\u00EDdli v historickom Joergesovom dome (N\u00E1mestie sv. Trojice). Pon\u00FAka vlastn\u00E9 z\u00E1kusky z cukr\u00E1renskej manufakt\u00FAry na pr\u00EDzem\u00ED, vn\u00FAtorn\u00E9 n\u00E1dvorie (Patio) a spr\u00EDstupnen\u00FA historick\u00FA bansk\u00FA \u0161t\u00F4l\u0148u Sab\u00EDna (cca 80 m).[[1]](https://google.com/goto?url=CAESVgHEIkXXy3uAUiK89xKKI6qVpSWA3obq6Xtan0AVPfUjtwLWkLsUXP-rprr7amBOb5OgGPumWZUWcr3jbTnacIfpo3US5PLG0kX1_z0mxse-azfrTcjS)[[2]](https://google.com/goto?url=CAESaQHEIkXXBlnwLBDHGMfJRbyMt-4kLqG1YZ9s2oGrHZyd6e-JQ_VP_Mg6rYHig1wHK25EVua3xIEQS3UyDquPgWsZOtqqnuQimIZ8OWmVepYg5fg_BNr3ddppi8GKNr8OZ6Hf6uWC0_rdSQ)\n- **Bansk\u00E1 Bystrica** \u2013 [Kaviare\u0148 Gavalier](https://google.com/goto?url=CAEScQHEIkXXQ8MX-P8-x14_zajYGfueWaPtOsoIVuUF1j3u1BmFE7ooOdejpLu9dpsaWGxfQlQ_T5XQs6Y13bBwYtZCrGQy9OW1hp2Tr3jDkLieK7HicU_-E7y-ntR1pb463NX7XJrv1SAr7U_y-XVvLPtJ) sa nach\u00E1dza v bl\u00EDzkosti Mestsk\u00E9ho parku. Jej osobitnou atrakciou je presklen\u00E1 gar\u00E1\u017E sl\u00FA\u017Eiaca ako v\u00FDstavn\u00FD priestor pre historick\u00E9 motoriek a aut\u00E1, talianska k\u00E1va Carraro a ponuka rumov.[[1]](https://google.com/goto?url=CAEScQHEIkXXQ8MX-P8-x14_zajYGfueWaPtOsoIVuUF1j3u1BmFE7ooOdejpLu9dpsaWGxfQlQ_T5XQs6Y13bBwYtZCrGQy9OW1hp2Tr3jDkLieK7HicU_-E7y-ntR1pb463NX7XJrv1SAr7U_y-XVvLPtJ)\n\n### 3. Psie plemeno\n\n\n---\n\n![](https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQcJLe8LxweWEZYG5grcmzTrpQLVrN4VANfFZ-tAAWkrMZV0yHsZrpRDac1zdk-N_cTBv1wVcLo7h_W1VUbmexvX4GmgocKwQyTBBvHwmKI-bPTSwl7RblXU5y743A)\n**Gavalier\u0161paniel kr\u00E1\u013E Karol** *(Cavalier King Charles Spaniel)* je ob\u013E\u00FAben\u00E9 spolo\u010Densk\u00E9 plemeno psa s dlh\u00FDmi u\u0161ami a hodv\u00E1bnou srs\u0165ou, zn\u00E1me svojou priate\u013Eskou a jemnou povahou.[[1]](https://google.com/goto?url=CAEShgEBxCJF17TisNd-Q43IegWmRL56JExxrcr6ulNkyiVOO4oF-0sl7sA3AEabVS4XEKWozsUTt0tuQ4v1fryiQEtIltqqEoUDYZw8sGvWaY4cicKZtkD5nv18h8n7FHp-reid2xPDZUeN6QdL2dtO8jHAVZl3vVlamUn4yBEjGBJMbGWXGrbE9Q)Zauj\u00EDma v\u00E1s **v\u00FDznam slova v konkr\u00E9tnej vete**, **otv\u00E1racie hodiny niektorej z kaviarn\u00ED** , alebo **inform\u00E1cie o psom plemenie**?","items":[{"type":"ai_overview_elem